              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Frosty lowered the leaf and considered this carefully.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Then my welcome can feel warm while I stay cold?",
